  "description": "<h2>Scholarship overview</h2>\n<p>The Swiss Government Excellence doctoral scholarship supports research with an approved Swiss academic host. Applicants need to arrange supervision and use the rules for their country of origin. The maintenance award should not be confused with an automatic waiver of every host-university fee.</p>\n<h2>Research Areas</h2>\n<ul><li>Eligible doctoral research subjects</li><li>International research</li><li>Doctoral study</li></ul>\n<h2>Funding and duration</h2>\n<table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;margin:14px 0;font-size:0.92em;line-height:1.45\"><thead style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;background:#eef3fb;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left\"><tr><th scope=\"col\" style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;background:#eef3fb;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left\">Component</th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;background:#eef3fb;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left\">Details</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">Award or position</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">PhD scholarship / studentship</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">Stipend / salary</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">CHF 2,450/month</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">Tuition</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">Fee waiver depends on the host; not automatic under the scholarship</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2>Eligibility and Requirements</h2>\n<table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;margin:14px 0;font-size:0.92em;line-height:1.45\"><thead style=\"border:1px solid #d9dee5;background:#eef3fb;padding:8px 10px;text-align:left\"><tr><th scope=\"col\" 